{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"huanchen-e-p190","title":"裴按泰不为太常孙盛改言自意","accounts":[{"id":"huanchen-a-4974adc55884bd3cbd9c","label":"裴注·注家按语","text":"裴按泰不为太常孙盛改言自意","evidence":["huanchen-q-5cb8cccbf014afb7be85"]}],"participants":[{"person":"shaodi-p0003","role":"按本传泰不为太常未详干宝所由知之、孙盛改易泰言虽为小胜、然检盛言诸所改易皆非别有异闻率更自以意制多不如旧、凡记言之体当使若出其口、辞胜而违实固君子所不取","evidence":["huanchen-q-5cb8cccbf014afb7be85"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["huanchen-q-5cb8cccbf014afb7be85"]},"ordering_evidence":"huanchen-q-5cb8cccbf014afb7be85","source_order":[22,308,292],"order":4559}],"persons":[{"id":"shaodi-p0003","name":"裴松之","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"huanchen-q-5cb8cccbf014afb7be85","section":"chapter-022","block":"b-901797ddbd952af29d74","layer":"pei","quote":"臣松之按本传，泰不为太常，未详干宝所由知之。孙盛改易泰言，虽为小胜。然检盛言诸所改易，皆非别有异闻，率更自以意制，多不如旧。凡记言之体，当使若出其口。辞胜而违实，固君子所不取，况复不胜而徒长虚妄哉","attribution":"裴注·注家按语","section_title":"桓二陈徐卫卢传第二十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0050.xhtml","index":307,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-0bbc954a34e821268698","start":292,"end":390,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
